#. module: child_compassion
#: model:field.office.learning,description:child_compassion.learning_rw8
msgid ""
"Sponsored children in Rwanda are also introduced to Rwandan national values "
"such as self-identity, loving the nation, unity, reconciliation and striving "
"toward self-reliance. Many projects teach Rwandan cultural dance as a way of "
"maintaining and owning the Rwandan culture.\n"
"\n"
"When they reach the age of 12, young people are involved in skills training, "
"such as computer training, carpentry, motor vehicle repair, dressmaking, "
"cooking, hair dressing, driving and life skills."
msgstr ""
"Sponsrade barn i Rwanda introduceras också till Rwandas nationella "
"värderingar som självidentitet, kärlek till nationen, enhet, försoning och "
"strävan mot självförsörjning. Många projekt lär ut rwandisk kulturell dans "
"som ett sätt att upprätthålla och äga den rwandiska kulturen.\n"
"\n"
"När de når 12 års ålder deltar ungdomar i kompetensutbildning, såsom "
"datorutbildning, snickeri, reparation av motorfordon, sömnad, matlagning, "
"frisering, körning och livskunskap."

